{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108065","id":2625680635,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cgLT7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108065","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108065.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108065.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108065","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108065/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108065/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108065/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7998b5e8d2ec4cac0e5b8e411823c5e4ef083ce9","number":108065,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Clean up numeric EditorProperty `setup()` methods","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, the numeric EditorProperty `setup()` methods are somewhat brittle. When these properties are created, they are first bundled into a struct, which is then destructed in the method call. This PR changes the signature of the numeric `setup()` calls to use the struct directly. This has several benefits:\r\n\r\n+ If any new functionality is wanted for these properties (like in #105878), this change makes it easy to make these changes without adding any arguments.\r\n+ It removes the use of \"magic numbers\". In several internal files, EditorPropertyIntegers are created directly (I don't know how much this should be encouraged). Their `setup()` calls have many seemingly arbitrary numbers and booleans that are hard to understand without looking at the `editor_properties.h` file. This change makes it clear within the file what the parameters that the code is changing.\r\n\r\nNote: In making this change I found multiple invalid calls to `setup()`, most looking like: `setup(-1, 99999, true);` where there is a boolean in the third argument (which is defined as `double p_step`). I'm not sure what the intention was originally, but making this change will prevent future invalid calls and help catch other invalid calls before they are propagated.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.gi